Block 1 of 6. The elevated block travels toward the row with its bottom clear of the placed partner.

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:06.800
Block 1 of 6. The block pauses over the aligned vertical side groove.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.600
Block 1 of 6. The block descends vertically. Its horizontal position stays fixed throughout insertion.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:09.100
Block 1 of 6. At the nominal seated position, the clamp opens.

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.000
Block 1 of 6. The clamp withdraws upward, then retreats from the row.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Block 1 of 6. The machine repositions for the next pickup.

